<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>When I come face to face with temptations,</l><l>It seems that I still haven’t yet learned.</l><l>So powerless my strength is to resist.</l><l>All I can do then is turn…</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>But even then, the guilt comes to haunt me:</l><l>My body’s full of weakness and sin.</l><l>Yet His word says, “new heart” He’s given me.</l><l>So I by faith say within…</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
